    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's been two years, I'm fairly sure. And there's a little breathlessness as well, um, three weeks now. With little breathlessness, it comes and goes.",
