      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, about the same, about a month. With dry tickly cough, maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day. It's worse with talking and lying down.",
